Title: Movement (PROTOTYPE fixture)
Format: Stage Play

===

[[FSE STAGE type=proscenium width=10 depth=7 units=m]]
[[FSE ENTITY door-sl type=entrance pos=5.5,1]]
[[FSE ENTITY door-sr type=entrance pos=-5.5,1]]
[[FSE ENTITY french-windows type=entrance pos=0,3.8]]
[[FSE ENTITY dsc type=mark pos=0,-2.5]]
[[FSE ENTITY fireplace type=mark pos=-4,2.5]]
[[FSE ENTITY mary type=cast]]
[[FSE ENTITY arthur type=cast]]
[[FSE ENTITY inspector type=cast cue="INSPECTOR GOOLE"]]
[[FSE ENTITY gerald type=cast]]
[[FSE ENTITY sofa type=prop pos=-1,0 label="Sofa"]]
[[FSE ENTITY table type=prop pos=2.5,1.5 label="Dining table"]]
[[FSE ENTITY chair type=prop pos=3.2,0.6]]
[[FSE ENTITY decanter type=prop on=table]]
[[FSE ENTITY photograph type=prop]]

## Scene 1

[[FSE PRESET mary pos=-1,0.3 facing=dsc; PRESET arthur pos=fireplace facing=90; PRESET gerald pos=3.2,0.6 facing=270; PRESET photograph with=inspector]]

!@Mary sits on the sofa. @Arthur warms himself at the fire. @Gerald reads.

MARY
Arthur, do stop fidgeting.

[[FSE ENTER inspector from=door-sl pos=3.5,-1.5 facing=250]]

INSPECTOR GOOLE
Good evening.

[[FSE MOVE mary pos=dsc facing=0; MOVE arthur pos=-2,1.5 facing=60]]

MARY
Who let you in?

[[FSE MOVE inspector pos=-3.8,0.8 facing=180]]

INSPECTOR GOOLE
A fine fire.

[[FSE SET photograph pos=-4.4,1.6]]

INSPECTOR GOOLE
Do you know this girl?

[[FSE MOVE chair pos=1,-1 by=gerald; MOVE gerald pos=1.5,-1.6 facing=270]]

GERALD
Sit down, Inspector.

[[FSE MOVE mary pos=2.5,2.4 until=arrive]]

MARY
I won't hear another word of this.

[[FSE MOVE arthur pos=1.4,0.2]]

ARTHUR
Mary, wait.

[[FSE VIA mary pos=-0.5,2.2]]

MARY
Not one word.

[[FSE ARRIVE mary facing=dsc]]

INSPECTOR GOOLE
Then I shall go.

[[FSE EXIT inspector via=french-windows; EXIT gerald via=door-sr]]

ARTHUR
Good riddance.
